ollamux (0.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New: prompt-cache affinity (on by default; --no-affinity /
    OLLAMUX_NO_AFFINITY to disable), X-Ollamux-Affinity header.
  * Fixed: OLLAMUX_NO_AFFINITY env var alone was ignored; affinity
    header now reports miss on unusable pins.

 -- Jonathan Stechmann <69059260+j-stechmann@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 01 Sep 2026 17:30:00 +0000

ollamux (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New: usage introspection (/_usage) and quota-aware key routing
    (--usage-aware[=PCT], default 80).
  * /_keys now embeds per-key usage data.

 -- Jonathan Stechmann <69059260+j-stechmann@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 01 Sep 2026 13:30:00 +0000

ollamux (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Logging is now silent by default; -v enables banner, request log
    and notices.
  * Errors are agent-friendly; responses carry an X-Ollamux header.

 -- Jonathan Stechmann <69059260+j-stechmann@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 30 Aug 2026 20:00:00 +0000

ollamux (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rebrand: omlx is now ollamux (Ollama multiplexer).
  * Environment variables, HTTP headers, error codes and config paths
    renamed accordingly (OLLAMUX_KEYS, X-Ollamux-*, ~/.config/ollamux).

